{"strongs": "H1346", "word": "גַּאֲוָה", "translit": "ga.a.vah", "root": "בתת", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "majesty, pride", "definition": "גַּאֲוָה noun feminine majesty, pride (compare Syriac ) — Job 41:7 + 6 t.; construct גַּאֲוַת Prov 29:23 + 2 t.; suffix גַּאֲוָתִי Isa 13:3 + 8 t.; — 1. rising up, swelling of the sea Ps 46:4 . 2. majesty , of Israel Deut 33:29 , Moab Isa 16:6 = Jer 48:29 , scales of crocodile Job 41:7 , of God Deut 33:26 ; Ps 68:35 . 3. pride, haughtiness Ps 10:2 ; Ps 31:19 ; Ps 31:24 ; Ps 36:12 ; Ps 73:6 ; Prov 14:3 ; Prov 29:23 ; Isa 9:8 ; Isa 13:11 ; Isa 25:11 עליזי גאותי my proudly exulting ones Isa 13:3 compare Zeph 3:11 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1399')\">BDB1399</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1346')\">H1346</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1398')\">BDB1398</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1400')\">BDB1400</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גַּאֲוָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>majesty, pride</highlightword> (compare Syriac <placeholder753/>) — <ref ref=\"Job 41:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,7)\">Job 41:7</ref> + 6 t.; construct <bdbheb>גַּאֲוַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 29:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,29,23)\">Prov 29:23</ref> + 2 t.; suffix <bdbheb>גַּאֲוָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 13:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,13,3)\">Isa 13:3</ref> + 8 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>rising up, swelling</highlight> of the sea <ref ref=\"Ps 46:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,46,4)\">Ps 46:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>majesty</highlight>, of Israel <ref ref=\"Deut 33:29\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,29)\">Deut 33:29</ref>, Moab <ref ref=\"Isa 16:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,6)\">Isa 16:6</ref> = <ref ref=\"Jer 48:29\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,29)\">Jer 48:29</ref>, scales of crocodile <ref ref=\"Job 41:7\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,7)\">Job 41:7</ref>, of God <ref ref=\"Deut 33:26\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,26)\">Deut 33:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 68:35\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"68\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"68\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(19,68,35)\">Ps 68:35</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>pride, haughtiness</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 10:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,10,2)\">Ps 10:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 31:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,19)\">Ps 31:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 31:24\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(19,31,24)\">Ps 31:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 36:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,12)\">Ps 36:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 73:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,6)\">Ps 73:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 14:3\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,3)\">Prov 14:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 29:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,29,23)\">Prov 29:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 9:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,8)\">Isa 9:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 13:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,13,11)\">Isa 13:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 25:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,25,11)\">Isa 25:11</ref> <bdbheb>עליזי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>גאותי</bdbheb> <hi